  "bio": "Delve into the heart of Münster's Hansaviertel where Taninasascha Ellifrank Tattoo Studio stands as a beacon of traditional tattoo artistry. Since opening its doors in 1992, this storied studio has cultivated a reputation for masterful ink work, steeped in the time-honored traditions of tätowierkunst. Here, under the seasoned hand of Frank Zimmermann, your skin becomes the canvas for classic designs that withstand the test of time.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Münster, North-rhine-westphalia, Germany"
